WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:16.083
Kip's hole was a mess.

2
00:00:16.084 --> 00:00:18.738
Stuff was everywhere.

3
00:00:18.739 --> 00:00:22.242
There were acorns all over the place.

4
00:00:22.243 --> 00:00:26.416
And there was no room for Kip!

5
00:00:26.417 --> 00:00:29.678
"You don't need a nest," said Bird.

6
00:00:29.679 --> 00:00:33.297
"You need to clean up this mess!"

7
00:00:33.298 --> 00:00:38.435
"You're right, Bird," said Kip.

8
00:00:38.436 --> 00:00:41.655
"I am going to clean it up."

9
00:00:41.656 --> 00:00:45.038
"No," said Bird.

10
00:00:45.039 --> 00:00:49.439
"We are going to clean it up."

11
00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:57.495
"Let's start with these acorns," said Bird.

12
00:00:57.496 --> 00:01:00.168
"Pick out the ones you want to keep.

13
00:01:00.169 --> 00:01:02.741
And we'll throw out the rest."

14
00:01:02.742 --> 00:01:12.946
They sorted the acorns into neat piles.

15
00:01:12.947 --> 00:01:18.092
Then they swept the floor.

16
00:01:18.093 --> 00:01:25.040
And they washed the dishes.

17
00:01:25.041 --> 00:01:31.290
Soon Kip's hole was nice and clean.

18
00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.889
"Well, Kip," said Bird.

19
00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:37.667
"Now you have plenty of room."

20
00:01:37.668 --> 00:01:39.909
Kip looked around.

21
00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:43.824
He rubbed his chin.

22
00:01:43.825 --> 00:01:46.590
"Thank you, Bird," said Kip.

23
00:01:46.591 --> 00:01:56.947
"Now I have room for more acorns!"
